WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Welcome to Communications and IT. This covers PR strategy, IT systems, and analytics for temple management.

c2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Communication and PR handles donor communications, press relations, social media, and crisis response. All external statements follow the approved messaging playbook.

c3
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:28.000
IT and Automation covers infrastructure, software systems, cybersecurity, and process automation across all departments.

c4
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Analytics and Intelligence provides dashboards for visitor footfall, donation trends, kitchen consumption, and department-level KPIs reported to the board.

c5
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:52.000
IT systems include the donor CRM, accounting software, HR and payroll systems, and inventory management tools. Access is role-based and reviewed quarterly.

c6
00:00:52.500 --> 00:01:04.000
Data quality is critical for analytics: single source of truth, defined data owners per domain, and daily reconciliation between source systems and the analytics warehouse.

c7
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:16.000
Communication protocols require sensitive donor information to be masked in reports and only shared with roles authorized by the Communication head.

c8
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:28.000
Automation opportunities include automated donation receipts, scheduled compliance reports, and vendor payment reminders. Each automation is documented and monitored.
